all Street for US$500bil in AI push\",\n     \"chars\": 3620\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:e7777109769b68857021b63b\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-07-27\",\n     \"title\": \"NVIDIA Pursues $750 Billion in New AI Deals Despite Financing Scrutiny\",\n     \"chars\": 3007\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:c46e192520be10cb02a54ca8\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-07-29\",\n     \"title\": \"Nvidia’s $750-billion AI bet deepens fears of a circular tech bubble\",\n     \"chars\": 7661\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:ba8e52b6f010b77f770e4483\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-07-27\",\n     \"title\": \"Nvidia: Reported OpenAI Deal Raises Circular Deal Fears, but We Think the Stock Is Undervalued\",\n     \"chars\": 2156\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:bb0d23846735c94b7c1722d2\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-07-27\",\n     \"title\": \"Nvidia's potential new deal with OpenAI would revive a spooky tech-bubble habit, analyst warns\",\n     \"chars\": 4245\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:6ea61aa936b9cea298c8cebb\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-07-27\",\n     \"title\": \"Why Nvidia Stock Fell Today\",\n     \"chars\": 1773\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:3c4e68045b4ddbbf33c0c232\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-08-11\",\n     \"title\": \"Nvidia taps Wall Street for $500 billion funding commitment\",\n     \"chars\": 6099\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:a174edf4402ddcabed87ba5c\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-08-02\",\n     \"title\": \"NVIDIA is about to spend $750 billion on AI. Critics are calling it a bubble\",\n     \"chars\": 5799\n    }\n   ]\n  },\n  \"T3 one price compared across two years\": {\n   \"hits\": 84,\n   \"order\": [\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:393f041679180b7d31179e8f\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-09-01\",\n     \"title\": \"Should NVIDIA Stock Be in Your Portfolio Post Solid Q2 Earnings?\",\n     \"chars\": 6400\n    },\n    {\n     \"input_id\": \"gnews:4a25b06d7e7bc70e994c3989\",\n     \"day\": \"2026-08-10\",\n     \"title\